{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 22,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "good",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " name is rather to be chosen than great riches,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " loving favor rather than silver and gold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The rich and the poor meet together:\nJehovah is the maker of them all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A prudent man seeth the evil, and hideth himself;\nBut the simple pass on, and suffer for it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The reward of humility ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the fear of Jehovah",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " riches, and honor, and life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thorns ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " snares are in the way of the perverse:\nHe that keepeth his soul shall be far from them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Train up a child in the way he should go,\nAnd even when he is old he will not depart from it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The rich ruleth over the poor;\nAnd the borrower is servant to the lender.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that soweth iniquity shall reap calamity;\nAnd the rod of his wrath shall fail.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that hath a bountiful eye shall be blessed;\nFor he giveth of his bread to the poor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Cast out the scoffer, and contention will go out;\nYea, strife and ignominy will cease.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that loveth pureness of heart,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "For",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the grace of his lips the king will be his friend.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The eyes of Jehovah preserve ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him that hath",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " knowledge;\nBut he overthroweth the words of the treacherous man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sluggard saith, There is a lion without;\nI shall be slain in the streets.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The mouth of strange women is a deep pit;\nHe that is abhorred of Jehovah shall fall therein.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Foolishness is bound up in the heart of a child;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "But",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the rod of correction shall drive it far from him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that oppresseth the poor to increase his ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "gain",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that giveth to the rich, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall come",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " only to want.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Incline thine ear, and hear the words of the wise,\nAnd apply thy heart unto my knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For it is a pleasant thing if thou keep them within thee,\nIf they be established together upon thy lips.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That thy trust may be in Jehovah,\nI have made ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " known to thee this day, even to thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Have not I written unto thee excellent thingsOf counsels and knowledge,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To make thee know the certainty of the words of truth,\nThat thou mayest carry back words of truth to them that send thee?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Rob not the poor, because he is poor;\nNeither oppress the afflicted in the gate:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For Jehovah will plead their cause,\nAnd despoil of life those that despoil them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Make no friendship with a man that is given to anger;\nAnd with a wrathful man thou shalt not go:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lest thou learn his ways,\nAnd get a snare to thy soul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be thou not one of them that strike hands,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Or",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of them that are sureties for debts.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thou hast not wherewith to pay,\nWhy should he take away thy bed from under thee?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Remove not the ancient landmark,\nWhich thy fathers have set.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.22.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.22.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seest thou a man diligent in his business? he shall stand before kings;\nHe shall not stand before mean men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
